        "What is blockchain? Distributed ledger technology basics",
        "Cryptographic hash functions and digital signatures",
        "Consensus mechanisms: PoW, PoS, DPoS, and BFT",
        "Block structure and chain formation",
        "Public vs Private blockchains",
        "Bitcoin architecture and transaction flow",
        "Ethereum basics and account models",
        "Gas, fees, and transaction ordering"
      ],
      "resources": [
